ch Terminal\", on the planet \"Serpulo\".\nThe video was recorded from Debian GNU/Linux trixie, with KDE Plasma, with the software OpenBroadcasterSoftware and post-produced with Kdenlive to cut the video.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Map and video and post-production by <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Valerio_Bozzolan\" title=\"User:Valerio Bozzolan\">Valerio Bozzolan</a>, videogame Mindustry created by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/Anuken\">Anuken</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry/commits/master/\">Mindustry contributors</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"GPLv3","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"video/webm"}]},"47268946":{"pageid":47268946,"ns":6,"title":"File:OBS - Razprava o sporazumu ACTA (28-02-2012).webm","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":736622471,"width":1280,"height":720,"duration":5935.116,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/OBS_-_Razprava_o_sporazumu_ACTA_%2828-02-2012%29.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:OBS_-_Razprava_o_sporazumu_ACTA_(28-02-2012).webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=47268946","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Javna pozornost glede trgovskega sporazuma za boj proti ponarejanju (ACTA) se je bistveno pove\u010dala ob koncu leta 2011, ko so posami\u010dne dr\u017eave udele\u017eenke pri japonski vladi, ki je depozitar sporazuma, pri\u010dele s podpisovanjem sporazuma ACTA. Ob vsebinskih vpra\u0161anjih so se v naj\u0161ir\u0161i javnosti odprla vpra\u0161anja glede (ne)primernosti postopka sprejemanja sporazuma, predvsem pa o mo\u017enih posledicah uveljavitve sporazuma za prihodnost interneta (pobuda: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://pobuda-acta.si\">http://pobuda-acta.si</a> ). Razprava je posebej aktualna zaradi pravkar opravljene javne predstavitve mnenj v Dr\u017eavnem zboru dne 17. februarja ter \u0161e vedno odprtih vpra\u0161anj glede potrebe po druga\u010dni obravnavi intelektualnih pravic v digitalni dobi.\n<p>Udele\u017eenci:\nNata\u0161a Pirc Musar, Informacijska poobla\u0161\u010denka\ndr. Maja Bogataj Jan\u010di\u010d, In\u0161titut IPI\nGorazd Bo\u017ei\u010d, vodja SI-CERT pri Arnesu\nVuk \u0106osi\u0107, spletni umetnik in aktivist\nprof. dr. J\u00f3zsef Gy\u00f6rk\u00f6s, UM FERI\n</p>\nprof. dr. Rajko Knez, UM PF","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/OutBoxSI\">Out of the box Seminar</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"video/webm"}]},"68682677":{"pageid":68682677,"ns":6,"title":"File:OBS Willem Wilmink (gesprek).webm","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":31031676,"width":1280,"height":720,"duration":111.69800000000001,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/OBS_Willem_Wilmink_%28gesprek%29.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:OBS_Willem_Wilmink_(gesprek).webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=68682677","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"OBS Willem Wilmink (gesprek)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/dwddtv\">DWDD</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"video/webm"}]},"163562764":{"pageid":163562764,"ns":6,"title":"File:Tint score of 49546.webm","index":26,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2802639,"width":900,"height":720,"dura